verride\",\n  \"when\": \"A user opens the lot forecast\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-5\",\n  \"given\": \"A lot forecast has no positive gain rate available\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-5.2\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The projected date field displays an unavailable value on the screen\",\n  \"when\": \"The user opens the forecast\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-5\",\n  \"given\": \"An authorized manager changes a yard default or lot-specific override, or a user without manager authorization opens forecast settings\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-5.3\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays the returned forecast values for saved changes, and does not show assumption-edit actions to a user without manager authorization\",\n  \"when\": \"The manager saves the assumption or the other user's screen renders\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-6\",\n  \"given\": \"The inventory response contains feed items and stock movements\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-6.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays each item's name, category, available quantity, unit, unit cost, dry-matter percentage, energy value, storage location, wastage setting when returned, and opening, received, consumed, and closing stock values\",\n  \"when\": \"A user opens the inventory screen\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-6\",\n  \"given\": \"An authorized inventory user records a receipt or adjustment, edits an item, or changes wastage settings\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-6.2\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays the saved inventory record and stock-movement values returned by the service\",\n  \"when\": \"The user submits the change\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-6\",\n  \"given\": \"A user has inventory viewing access but lacks inventory-edit access\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-6.3\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays inventory values and does not show enabled item, receipt, adjustment, or wastage-edit actions\",\n  \"when\": \"The user opens inventory\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-7\",\n  \"given\": \"The projection response contains available stock, upcoming saved feed plans, and wastage-adjusted estimates\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-7.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays the returned projected consumption and closing or remaining inventory for daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly, semi-annual, and annual horizons, along with the configured wastage ratio\",\n  \"when\": \"A user selects each supported projection horizon\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-7\",\n  \"given\": \"The projection response has no saved upcoming feed plans for an item\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-7.2\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays the response's empty-data state for that item's projected inventory\",\n  \"when\": \"A user opens inventory projections\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-7\",\n  \"given\": \"The inventory service returns a known actual-wastage movement and delivered-feed consumption\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-7.3\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen lists actual wastage as a separate movement from delivered-feed consumption\",\n  \"when\": \"A user views the stock movement list\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-8\",\n  \"given\": \"An authorized ration manager creates or revises a ration\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-8.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays fields for ration name and type, ingredients, proportions, intended animal type or weight range, dry matter, energy, and cost per unit\",\n  \"when\": \"The manager enters ration details and ingredient proportions\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-8\",\n  \"given\": \"The ration service returns nutrition values and calculated ingredient-mix cost\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-8.2\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays the returned nutrition values and calculated cost per pound\",\n  \"when\": \"The ration screen renders the response\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-8\",\n  \"given\": \"An authorized ration manager has selected nutrition requirements and candidate mixes\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-8.3\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen identifies the returned lowest-cost mix that meets the selected requirements and displays its nutrition and cost values with a separate save action\",\n  \"when\": \"The manager runs optimization\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-8\",\n  \"given\": \"An optimized candidate is displayed and the user has not selected a save action, or a user without ration-management access opens the ration screen\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-8.4\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The candidate is displayed without being shown as a saved ration, and the unauthorized user's screen displays existing rations without create, revise, or optimize actions\",\n  \"when\": \"The screen renders\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-8\",\n  \"given\": \"The optimization response indicates that no candidate mix meets the selected nutrition requirements\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-8.5\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays that no mix qualifies and does not show an enabled save action for a qualifying mix\",\n  \"when\": \"The manager views the optimization result\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-9\",\n  \"given\": \"An authorized planner selects a date, pen, bunk rate, ration, and animal count\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-9.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The plan request contains those selected values and the screen displays the returned plan's date, pen, assigned lot or lots, animal count, ration, planned quantity, planned time, quantity per animal, total feed cost, expected energy intake, and status\",\n  \"when\": \"The planner submits the plan\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-9\",\n  \"given\": \"A user lacks planning access and opens feed planning\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-9.2\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays existing plans without plan-generation or plan-adjustment actions\",\n  \"when\": \"The screen renders using the user's returned permissions\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-10\",\n  \"given\": \"A saved plan's pen count, bunk rate, animal count, or ration assignment changes after generation\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-10.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays the saved plan unchanged and a review flag\",\n  \"when\": \"The user opens the plan\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-10\",\n  \"given\": \"An authorized planner opens a plan flagged for review\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-10.2\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen shows authorized confirm-update and regenerate actions\",\n  \"when\": \"The plan screen renders\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-10\",\n  \"given\": \"An authorized planner confirms an update or regenerates a flagged plan\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-10.3\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The plan request contains the selected action and the screen displays the response status and returned plan\",\n  \"when\": \"The planner submits the selected action\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-10\",\n  \"given\": \"An operator is assigned to the plan's pen\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-10.4\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays the returned status value for that pen's plan\",\n  \"when\": \"The operator updates the execution status\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-10\",\n  \"given\": \"Actual bunk intake differs from the saved plan\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-10.5\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays actual intake and variance while the saved plan values remain unchanged\",\n  \"when\": \"The user views the feeding plan and activity\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-10\",\n  \"given\": \"An operator is not assigned to the plan's pen and the screen renders using the operator's returned permissions\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-10.6\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays the current status and does not show an enabled status-update action\",\n  \"when\": \"The operator opens the plan\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-10\",\n  \"given\": \"The service refuses a status update submitted by an operator who is not assigned to the plan's pen\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-10.7\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays the returned refusal error and the current plan status remains displayed\",\n  \"when\": \"The operator submits the status update\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-11\",\n  \"given\": \"An operational user enters feeding date, pen, ration, planned quantity, actual delivered quantity for the pen, and status for a pen containing one or more lots, and enters a delivered quantity for each lot such that the lot quantities sum to the pen's actual delivered quantity\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-11.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The feeding request contains the entered fields and a delivered-quantity allocation for each affected lot whose total equals the pen's actual delivered quantity, and the screen displays the response status and returned event fields including the lot allocations\",\n  \"when\": \"The user submits the feeding event\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-11\",\n  \"given\": \"A successful feeding response contains calculated values\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-11.2\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays actual-minus-planned variance, feed cost, energy value, inventory consumed by ingredient, and cumulative lot feed consumption and cost\",\n  \"when\": \"The event screen renders the response\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-11\",\n  \"given\": \"A successful feeding response contains planned quantity of 100 pounds, actual delivered quantity of 115 pounds, and a returned variance value of 15 pounds\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-11.3\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays the returned variance value of 15 pounds\",\n  \"when\": \"The event screen renders the response\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-11\",\n  \"given\": \"A feeding response includes actual delivered quantity and an inventory movement\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-11.4\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"The screen displays stock consumption for the delivered quantity and known wastage as a separate movement rather than